[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2507287038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99807#issuecomment-2507287038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99807","id":2507287038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vcin-","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T08:10:18Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T08:10:18Z","body":"Proxy authentication is not supported currently.\n\nAs a workaround, you can setup a local proxy to do the authentication as a middle-man.\n\n> specify a host that contains a username, as is a common practice with proxies\n\nAs far as I know, specifying username and password (`scheme://user:pass@host/path`) is part of the URL syntax rather than part of the host.\n\np.s. Your call to `HTTPClient.connect()` passed `https://ip.oxylabs.io/location` as the host. It should not include the `/location` part.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2507287038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4529280919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99807#issuecomment-4529280919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99807","id":4529280919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDfdXlw","user":{"login":"Geonode-JP","id":31045309,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDQ1MzA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31045309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP","html_url":"https://github.com/Geonode-JP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geonode-JP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-24T16:10:12Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T16:10:12Z","body":"The problem in #99807 is probably related to when Godot's HTTPClient sends the `Proxy-Authorization` header during a CONNECT tunnel — it needs to go in the CONNECT handshake itself, not the request that follows. Oxylabs residential proxies specifically require credentials on that initial CONNECT line, so if they're being sent later, the tunnel just won't establish.\n\nTo narrow it down: try a datacenter proxy with a simpler auth flow and see if the tunnel comes up cleanly. If it does, the issue is credential timing during CONNECT, not anything in the TLS layer.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4529280919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]